SM-T715: a new message plays feedbackd's message-new-sms and asks t715-keys for a
glance at the screen. Only calls ring upstream, so with the screen off a message
went unnoticed. The sound follows the same rules as the notification, plus Do Not
Disturb. Against omatel 0.2.4.

